# Keep the Cloud Build upload small; the image rebuilds SPA + deps from source.
.git
.gitignore
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
# Every virtualenv flavour, not just the literal name. RUNNING-LOCALLY.md tells you to
# create .venv-local, which "**/.venv" does not match; that quietly added 500MB to the
# Cloud Build upload on every deploy. Git never noticed because uv writes a .gitignore
# containing "*" inside the venv itself.
**/.venv*
**/.pytest_cache
frontend/dist
extension/*.zip
*.db
.env
*.env
!*.env.example
